cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Wazuh Alert Manager"
abstract: >-
  An OpenSearch Dashboards plugin that turns Wazuh alerts into a security
  operations workbench: an alert lifecycle (open / in progress / closed) with
  assignment and audit history, investigative cases with an attack-path graph
  and MITRE kill-chain view, and a trigger/action automation engine that
  escalates alert bursts into cases and auto-closes or auto-assigns routine
  alerts, with deterministic triage aids (precedent and suggested related
  alerts) and per-analyst reporting.
type: software
